OL,3,ACustomers report service outages at
OL,4,Amajor US banks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe issue comes after a string of
OL,7,Funrelated technical problems last week,
OL,8,Fincluding a massive Microsoft outage,
OL,9,Fas well as a telecommunications issue
OL,10,Fand network failure that grounded all
OL,11,FUS flights.
